# Telemetry 组件集成指南

> 本文档将指导你一步步完成 OpenTelemetry 可观测性组件的集成。

---

## 📋 前置条件

- [ ] 你的应用已经使用 `go-ygctl new http` 创建
- [ ] 你有一个 OTLP Collector (如 Jaeger, OpenObserve)
- [ ] Go 版本 >= 1.21

---

## 🚀 Step 1: 添加配置

```yaml
telemetry:
  enabled: true
  service_name: "{{.Config.service_name}}"
  service_version: "1.0.0"
  
  exporter:
    type: "{{.Config.exporter_type}}"
{{- if eq .Config.exporter_type "otlp-grpc"}}
    endpoint: "localhost:4317"
{{- else if eq .Config.exporter_type "otlp-http"}}
    endpoint: "http://localhost:4318/v1/traces"
{{- else if eq .Config.exporter_type "jaeger"}}
    endpoint: "http://localhost:14268/api/traces"
{{- end}}
  
  sampler:
    type: "ratio"
    ratio: 1.0

{{- if .Config.enable_metrics}}
  metrics:
    enabled: true
    export_interval: 30s
    http:
      enabled: true
    database:
      enabled: true
{{- end}}
```

---

## 🚀 Step 2: 注册组件

```go
import "github.com/KOMKZ/go-yogan-framework/telemetry"

app.Register(
    telemetry.NewComponent(),
)
```

